# easydns_domain_registration_statuses (Data Source)

{{tffile "examples/data-sources/domain_registration_statuses/example_1.tf"}}

Results are sorted by domain name. The auto-renewal card identifier that the API returns is deliberately not exposed by this data source; use `easydns_domain_registration_settings` if you need it for a specific domain.

## Contract note

The pinned OpenAPI document types this response as a single-domain object even though the operation returns a whole account. The provider accepts the domain-keyed object, an array of self-naming objects, and a bare single-domain object, so a contract correction on the EasyDNS side will not break this data source.

